{
  "name": "Helve — Multi-Engine Competitor Research Brief (Self-Hosted)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Multi-Engine Competitor Research Brief\nRuns multi-engine web search (`helve.web_search` fusion) + clean Markdown page extraction (`helve.web_extract`) through 1 `HELVE_API_KEY` at 0% markup (~$0.02/run).\n\n1. Install `n8n-nodes-helve` under Settings -> Community Nodes.\n2. Add a Helve API credential (`sk_live_...` — $1 free credit at helve.dev/signup).\n3. Edit the topic in **Set Topic** and click **Test workflow**.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "topic",
              "name": "topic",
              "value": "self-hosted workflow automation pricing 2026",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "set-topic-1",
      "name": "Set Topic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        420,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "webSearch",
        "query": "={{ $json.topic }}",
        "searchProvider": "fusion",
        "maxResults": 5,
        "spendLimitUsd": 0.1
      },
      "id": "helve-search-1",
      "name": "Helve: Web Search (Fusion)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-helve.helve",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        380
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "helveApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Helve API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const res = $input.first().json;\nconst results = res.results || res.data?.results || res.result?.results || [];\nconst urls = results.slice(0, 3).map(r => r.url).filter(Boolean);\nreturn [{ json: { urls: urls.join('\\n'), search_cost_usd: res._helve_execution?.cost_usd || 0, result_count: results.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "code-urls-1",
      "name": "Pick Top 3 URLs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "webExtract",
        "urls": "={{ $json.urls }}",
        "extractProvider": "auto",
        "extractOptions": {
          "format": "markdown",
          "summary": true,
          "maxChars": 8000
        },
        "spendLimitUsd": 0.15
      },
      "id": "helve-extract-1",
      "name": "Helve: Extract Pages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-helve.helve",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        380
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "helveApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Helve API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pipeline Stages\n1. **Configure Topic**: Edit `topic` in **Set Topic**.\n2. **Search & Extract**: **Helve: Web Search (Fusion)** queries multiple engines under a `$0.05` cap, **Pick Top 3 URLs** selects top links, and **Helve: Extract Pages** returns clean Markdown + summaries under a `$0.10` cap.\n\n*Requires self-hosted n8n with `n8n-nodes-helve@0.1.0`.*",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-stages-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Pipeline Stages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Topic",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Topic": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Helve: Web Search (Fusion)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Helve: Web Search (Fusion)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Pick Top 3 URLs",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Pick Top 3 URLs": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Helve: Extract Pages",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
